  "text": "CDC Consumer Guide: Common Cold Prevention and Self-Care | Publisher: Centers for Disease \nNasal Congestion & Sinus Pressure Relief\nNon-pharmacological measures for nasal discomfort: - Saline Spray: Use\nsterile saline nasal sprays to keep nasal passages moist. - Warm Compress:\nApply a warm washcloth over your nose and forehead to ease sinus pressure.\nPage 3 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
